[Applause]  [Music]  tomorrow I am releasing a video that I  had already shot and edited in which I  address some things relating to JK  Rowling the video was not exclusively  about her I don't break down everything  that she had said up to that point and  it was shot prior to the release of her  three thousand word essay which was I  supposed meant to justify things she has  been saying but I'm not really going to  delve into that too much either I did a  serious breakdown back in December when  the Maya for stater that happened I  don't have the energy to go over what  she said previously now what she's  released in this essay I am going to  recommend two videos by Jessie gender  both linked in the description that do  an excellent job of breaking down both  of those and explaining the problems  what I need to talk about here because I  don't address it in tomorrow's video  because things hadn't quite escalated to  the to the point they are right now when  I shot it I need to talk about to what  degree Harry Potter is going to have a  place in my life and on this channel  now you may have guessed from the fact  that I am wearing my slithering gear  that I am NOT planning to get rid of all  my stuff  I did consider it last night I actually  came here into the office where I shoot  intent on taking down any visible items  on the shelf relating to Harry Potter  but I found that when I reached for them  I stopped the reason I stopped wasn't  because I'm so in love with Harry Potter  I liked Harry Potter a lot the books the  movies were things that I enjoyed its  the fandom that I loved it's the  community that I love it's my house  that I love and those things are  separate from the author who are the  works they grew out of that but she did  not create the fandom in the way the  fandom works or the way that I have  operated within it and not to mention  all of the things that I mentioned or  that you see their gifts Hedwig figurine  up there this sweater this tie I have  bookends all of these were gifts given  to me by people know me and love me and  accept me and I will not throw away  thoughtful gifts given to me by my  friends and family because of someone  else's hate  that said you are not going to see me in  this outfit  for some time I have no intention to  talk in future about Harry Potter on  this channel I consider taking my old  videos down both the positive and the  critical ones I'm not going to do that  but what I am going to do is I am going  to put a comment on each one of those  videos with a link to this video and pin  it as the top comment on those to give  context of where I am now versus when I  made those videos while I do not intend  to get rid of my Harry Potter stuff I'm  also not going to purchase anything  related to Harry Potter and future even  if it was created and unofficial means  you know things like Etsy which you know  wouldn't be done as official merchandise  and I would also ask as much as I adore  the gifts that I have I would ask that  if anyone wants to send me anything in  future that it not be Harry Potter  themed I've gone through my Amazon  wishlist and removed any Harry Potter  related items from it I don't want my  money going towards this franchise  anymore nor do I want other people's  money going towards it to give me things  when the next fantastic beast movie  comes out I will not pay to see it my  original intent if you'd asked me a week  ago was that I was probably going to go  see it but I was also going to donate  the cost of my ticket to a trans charity  to try and balance the books but that's  not good enough I'm I can't in good  conscience put money towards this  franchise anymore but I'm still going to  keep what I have  I'm going to hold on to my connections  that I have either built or have been  strengthened through a shared love of  this property this property the story  these books these movies that are about  acceptance they are about finding your  place in the world they are about coming  into a world that is more accepting and  right for you than the world that you  lived in for most of your life it's  about all those things and for those  reasons I will hold onto it for now  there may come a time where I may decide  to move on from it but if I do it will  be at my time at my pace and am i  choosing not because I felt forced out  if you feel the need to get rid of your  Harry Potter things if you have them I  understand if you think I am wrong and  you are mad at me that I intend to keep  my Harry Potter related things I also  understand but the simple fact is that I  am a stubborn bastard I am cunning I am  ambitious I am a Slytherin your hate is  not going to move me but I do hope that  you will put thought towards what has  been said and I hope you do not ignore  it I wish now only to remind you that  you are beautiful you are valid and you  are loved you are the counsel I'm only  running the meetings and barring  tomorrow's video which has already been  shot and edited  this will be the last time for the  foreseeable future that this council  will address Harry Potter fantastic  beasts or miss Rowling and for this time  until we meet again this council is  adjourned  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

